      "description": "Sets the runtime setting for the measurements folder (persisted in the gitignored local settings file; wins over PIANOID_MEASUREMENTS_DIR and the default). path: an ABSOLUTE folder that exists or can be created and is writable (it is created); null or \"\" clears the setting (back to the env var / default). Existing data is NOT moved: runs in the old folder are no longer listed. Refused while a rig job runs. Result = the new modal.measurements_dir state.",
